; system  pendulum: fp64, rne, rk4, h = 0.015625
; tangent w (slots 2..3)
; target  sw; 10 steps a segment
; a step  1780 ALU, 17 loads, 17 stores, 0 copies, and the endrep
; registers 29 (r3..r31)
; routines sin 4, cos 4 a step: 1736 of the ALU instructions in quiet regions, 8 raises, 16 brackets (revision 8's flag control)

